how to make x branch as default in github in place of main or master?
Go to your repository on GitHub.com
Click Settings (top menu of the repo)
Click Branches (left sidebar, under "Code and automation")
Under "Default branch" you'll see your current default (main or master)
Click the two-arrows icon (switch/rename button) next to it
Select your x branch from the dropdown
Click Update
GitHub will warn you — click "I understand, update the default branch
